# input/intermediate/final_output ARE committed (known-good reference
# snapshot) — intentionally NOT ignored. They're regenerated byte-for-byte
# identically every run (fixed random seed), so there's nothing to merge-
# conflict over; just don't hand-edit them.

# Recording deliverables — large binaries, dropped in locally, not source
*/recordings/*.mp4
*/recordings/*.zip

# Internal reference material — not needed to execute the use cases on the Mac
reference_screenshots/

# Claude Code session/resume context — internal planning notes, not a client deliverable
CLAUDE.md

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
